# Keep line endings consistent between Windows and the GitHub Actions runner.
#
# Without this, editing a file on Windows can convert it to CRLF while the
# runner writes LF. Git then reports every line of the file as changed, which
# buries real changes in noise and creates pointless merge conflicts.
#
# fixtures.json is the one that matters: the daily workflow rewrites it on
# Linux, and Jake edits it on Windows.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
